RTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"We will email you when it is ready to collect.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Source B states that borrowers are notified by email when items are ready to collect.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-003\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"When a requested item arrives, print a hold slip and fold it into the item so the name is visible from the spine.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Source A describes the exact procedure for handling reserved items upon arrival.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-004\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Shelve items alphabetically by the borrower's surname.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Source A directly states items are shelved alphabetically by borrower's surname.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-005\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"You have 7 days from the day we email you.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Source B indicates the 7-day hold period starts from notification, matching the claim.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-006\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Day one is the day the borrower is notified, not the day the item arrived.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Source A explicitly clarifies that day one is the notification day, not arrival day.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-007\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Sweep the shelf every morning before opening.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Source A directly states the shelf is swept every morning before opening.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-008\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"An item you do not collect goes back into circulation or on to the next person waiting.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Source B states uncollected items go back into circulation.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-009\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Items past 7 days go back into circulation, or on to the next borrower in the queue if there is one.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Source A states uncollected items move to the next borrower in the queue if available.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-010\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"If you cannot get in within the week, ask us before the 7 days are up and we will hold the item for another 7 days.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Source B describes the extension process, matching the claim's conditions.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-011\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"We can do this once per reservation.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Source B explicitly states the extension is granted once per reservation.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-012\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"An item that has been on the hold shelf twice without being collected goes back to the shelves and the request is cancelled.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Source A states the item goes back to the shelves after being held twice without collection.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-013\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"If this happens twice with the same reservation, the reservation is cancelled and you will need to reserve it again.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Source B states the reservation is cancelled if the item is not collected twice.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-014\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"you will need to reserve it again.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Source B indicates that a new reservation must be placed to request the item after cancellation.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```","ttft_ms":21066,"type":"result","duration_ms":26571,"uuid":"f77da3f6-c4b8-4f57-9837-57332af16f37","ttft_stream_ms":1045,"time_to_request_ms":93,"first_content_frame_ms":1046,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
